{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20577","headline":"送友人卢处士游吴越 · 张籍","name":"送友人卢处士游吴越","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羡君东去见残梅，惟有王孙独未回。\n吴苑夕阳明古堞，越宫春草上高台。\n波生野水雁初下，风满驿楼潮欲来。\n试问渔舟看雪浪，几多江燕荇花开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}